         resumes polling after a cold boot.
      polls and is answered ......... yes       (7 polls, 7 replies, 7 paired, 0 unanswered)
      synchronises .................. yes       (its own stratum 6 from a stratum-5 server, Leap status Normal)
      corrects the clock ............ yes       (chronyd stepped the clock by 14.836050 s)
      counter matches the wire ...... yes       (Client Valid Received 7 against 7 paired replies)
      unreachable server not used ... correct   (reach 0, no `*`, and zero NTP packets sent to it)
