  tools/ntpwire.py on t33400-s1-sync.pcap:
03:52:59.170712 v4 10.38.22.34:42599 -> 10.38.22.33:123  client v4 LI=ok st=0 refid=----  xmit=04:39:39.534108
03:52:59.170985 v4 10.38.22.33:123   -> 10.38.22.34:42599 server v4 LI=ok st=5 refid=10.32.16.2 xmit=03:52:59.170929
